        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\n\ntitle Online Retail Data Engineering Architecture\n\ntop to bottom direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam roundcorner 15\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam ArrowThickness 2\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\nrectangle \&quot;UCI Online Retail Dataset\\nCSV / Excel\&quot; as Source #E8F1FC\n\npackage \&quot;Databricks Free Edition\&quot; #F8FAFC {\n\n    database \&quot;BRONZE LAYER\\nRaw Retail Data\\nDelta Table\&quot; as Bronze #E8C49E\n\n    rectangle \&quot;01_Data_Cleaning\\nPySpark\\nData Cleaning and Validation\&quot; as Cleaning #DBEAFE\n\n    database \&quot;SILVER LAYER\\nCleaned and Validated Data\\nDelta Table\&quot; as Silver #E2E8F0\n\n    rectangle \&quot;02_Data_Transformation\\nPySpark and SQL\\nBusiness Aggregations\&quot; as Transformation #DBEAFE\n\n    database \&quot;GOLD LAYER\\nBusiness Analytics Tables\\nSales | Customers | Products\&quot; as Gold #FDE68A\n\n    rectangle \&quot;Databricks SQL\\nBusiness Intelligence\&quot; as SQL #D1FAE5\n\n    rectangle \&quot;Lakeflow Jobs\\nAutomated ETL Pipeline\\nDaily at 8:00 AM\\nAsia/Colombo\&quot; as Jobs #E9D5FF\n\n    Source --&gt; Bronze : Data Ingestion\n\n    Bronze --&gt; Cleaning\n    Cleaning --&gt; Silver\n    Silver --&gt; Transformation\n    Transformation --&gt; Gold\n    Gold --&gt; SQL\n\n    Jobs -[dashed]-&gt; Cleaning : Task 01\n    Jobs -[dashed]-&gt; Transformation : Task 02\n\n}\n\nrectangle \&quot;Online Retail Analytics Dashboard\\n7 KPI Cards | 8 Charts\\nBusiness Insights\&quot; as Dashboard #BBF7D0\n\nSQL --&gt; Dashboard : Visualization\n\nlegend bottom\n    Solid arrows: Data flow\n    Dashed arrows: Workflow orchestration\nendlegend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="FI7PSAXkepN9aVyn1xVI-1">
